WEBVTT

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.260
(ECHOING) Cool!

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.460
(ECHOING) Cool!

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.940
(OVER RADIO) Roger.
We are ready for launch.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.620
DASH: Vi, Vi!

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.380
What did you do?

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.060
(OVER RADIO)
ETA two-niner. Over.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.340
TCI clear.
Condition yellow.
Status norm.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:10.060
Not responding to IFF.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.980
IRCM reads negative.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:15.180
Bob.
What?

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.500
I didn't say anything.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:34.620
(BIRD SOUNDS)

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.860
(YELLS IN DISGUST)

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.500
ROBOT:
Identification, please.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:49.260
Hey!

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.020
Hey, Violet!
Come here, look.
It talks!

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:52.340
What? What?

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.860
There. That one.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.580
Voice key incorrect.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.300
"Voice key"?

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.060
Voice key incorrect.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.740
Wait a second.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.860
(ALARM SOUNDS)

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.460
What do we do?
Run!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:07.580
Where are we going?
Away from here!

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:16.060
PA: Intruder alert.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.180
There isn't much time.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.420
No, there isn't.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.900
In fact, there's
no time at all.
(CHOKING)

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.100
Please...
Why are you here?

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.780
How can you possibly
bring me lower?

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.220
What more can you
take away from me?

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.820
(CHOKING) Family
survived the crash.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:55.940
They're here
on the island!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:57.380
They're alive?

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:00.780
(GASPING, COUGHING)

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.900
Helen?
Hello.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.100
You must be Mrs...

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.300
She was helping me
to escape.
No.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.380
That's what I was doing.
Let go of me!

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:24.500
Let go, you lousy, lying,
unfaithful creep!

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.460
How could I betray
the perfect woman?

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.380
Oh, you're referring
to me now?

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.620
Where are the kids?

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.500
They triggered the alert.
What?

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.540
Security's in the jungle.
Get going.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:36.980
Our kids are in danger?

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:38.820
If you suspected danger,
why'd you bring them?

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.460
They stowed away.
You're not striking
the proper tone.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:51.780
GUARD:
Think they're supers?

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.300
Dash, remember
what Mom said.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.860
What?
GUARD 2: Stop talking!

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.740
Hold it! Freeze!

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:59.060
VIOLET: Dash, run!

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:00.940
What?
VIOLET: Run!

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:02.820
They're supers!

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.180
Get the boy!

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.100
Show yourself!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.340
(SPITTING)

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.300
(DASH SCREAMS)

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:09.060
Hey!

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.020
DASH: Ha, ha!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.020
I'm alive. Yeah!

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.620
(DASH SHOUTING)

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:38.980
DASH: Uh-oh.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.940
(WATER SLOSHING)

